even under moderate temperature shifts. The study, published in the plant cell, was conducted by researchers

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:25.100
at Friedrich Schiller University, Jaina, and the Leibnitz-Ekruv. The scale of the response suggests broad

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:32.440
effects on aquatic and soil ecosystems under climate change. Gene activity shifts occurred across multiple

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:38.880
functional categories rather than isolated pathways. Adjusting the number of bubbles inside each

